---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
---

{% set featuredArtist = collections.featuredArtists[0] %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrapper hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <h1>Come draw with us.</h1>
      <p class="lede">A queer figure drawing group in Seattle with no pressure and no judgment. Bring a friend or make a new one here. ☺︎</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button" href="{{ site.nextEventUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">RSVP</a>
        <a class="button ghost" href="{{ site.signupUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Get updates</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-media">
      <img src="/assets/images/hero.jpeg" alt="Artists drawing together at Figure It Out." loading="eager"/>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="next-event" id="next-event">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <h2>Next event</h2>
    <div class="event-card">
      <h3 class="event-title">Figure It Out: Bound to inspire!</h3>
      <div class="event-card-body">
        <div class="event-details">
          <p>
            <strong>Date:</strong>
            Tuesday, November 10, 2026</p>
          <p>
            <strong>Time:</strong>
            Social at 6 PM. Drawing at 7 PM.</p>
          <p>
            <strong>Location:</strong>
            <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Vermillion%2C%201508%2011th%20Ave%2C%20Seattle%2C%20WA%2098122" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Vermillion, 1508 11th Ave, Seattle, WA 98122</a></p>
          <p>
            <strong>Cost:</strong>
            $15</p>
          <p>
            <strong>Models:</strong>
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/_tied_boi/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">@_tied_boi</a> and Phil (<a href="https://www.instagram.com/philrund/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">@philrund</a>)</p>
          <p>
            <strong>Rope work:</strong>
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/ropes.sweat.and.tears/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">@ropes.sweat.and.tears</a></p>
          <div class="event-notes">
            <p>A new twist on figure drawing: our first Figure It Out with two models in rope bondage. All three have joined FIO as artists. This time, they’re giving us a whole new set of lines to draw.</p>
            <p>All levels welcome. No experience required.</p>
            <p>Net proceeds donated to <a href="https://www.lifelong.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Lifelong</a>.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Bring drawing materials; a pencil and paper is plenty.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>No photos of the models. Photos of artwork are welcome.</p>
          </div>
          <a class="button" href="{{ site.nextEventUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">RSVP / Sign up</a>
        </div>
        <div class="event-media">
          <img src="/assets/images/2026-11-10_tied-boi-phil.png" alt="Figure It Out poster with two models in pink-tinted rope bondage against a lavender background, advertising November 10 at Vermillion." loading="lazy"/>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% if featuredArtist %}
  {% set artist = featuredArtist %}
  {% set artistHeaderContent = featuredArtist.templateContent | artistHeaderContent %}
  {% set showReadMore = true %}
  {% set portraitLoading = "lazy" %}
  <section class="next-event featured-artist-preview" id="featured-artist">
    <div class="wrapper">
      <h2>Featured artist</h2>
      {% include "partials/artist-header-card.njk" %}
    </div>
  </section>
{% endif %}
